Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:04:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 260/260] [ae-patch] Keep the rail's compact warning on one
 line

The Context card's amber warning wrapped to two lines in the rail. The rail
now shows a shorter line ("405k tokens, re-read on every reply."), truncates
it as a backstop on a narrow rail, and keeps the full sentence as its tooltip.
The dock's Compact card keeps the full sentence.
